~ start
set State.in_dialogue = true

Phone: The unknown number is calling again...
- Answer
	Unknown Number: Wow, You actually did it, You Assassinated Him... Good job.
	Unknown Number: We have wired 1 Million Dollars to your bank account.
	Unknown Number: Nice work.
	set State.finished_final = true
	set State.in_dialogue = false
	set State.gameover = true
	=> END
- Decline
	set State.rang = true
	=> start
	
set State.finished_final = true
set State.in_dialogue = false
set State.gameover = true
=> END